            "eyebrow": "Decision · handover",
            "title": "What must be communicated?",
            "body": "A weak referral note can undo good emergency care. Choose the strongest handover."
          },
          "question": {
            "prompt": "What should your referral communication include?",
            "options": [
              {
                "text": "Document vitals, danger signs, treatments already given, and call receiving unit with ETA",
