            "right": "Correct. Clear handover with Daniel's abnormal vitals and interventions supports continuity and faster receiving-facility decisions.",
            "wrong": "This case has high-risk instability. Minimal or delayed handover increases transfer risk and repeats work at the receiving center."
          }
        },
