            ]
          },
          "coach": {
            "eyebrow": "Case complete",
            "title": "Key teaching points",
            "body": "Daniel's confusion, BP 86/54, RR 32/min, and poor oral intake required emergency referral logic from the first minute. Uganda Clinical Guidelines 2023 support immediate stabilization and pre-referral treatment without waiting for complete outpatient diagnostics.",
